<title>SWITZERLAND: EMS prefers share buy-back to dividend.</title>
<headline>EMS prefers share buy-back to dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMS Group said it prefers the option of a share buy-back by its holding company rather than paying a dividend on 1996/97 results, chairman Christoph Blocher said.</p>
<p>Blocher said the group will look at the possibility of a buy-back and no dividend.</p>
<p>&quot;There is more likely to be no dividend and instead a holding company share buy-back,&quot; Blocher said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
